    "detailed_description": "Class Kingdom is a RPG&amp;Tower-Defense solo-indie game.<br />\r\nAs the player, you need to save your kingdom!.<br />\r\nMonsters will be rushing from portals to destroy your kingdom, you need to use your power and abilities to destroy them first!<br />\r\nAfter you've reached the first boss of the game you will get to choose your class!<br />\r\nYou can pick either Fighter, Archer or Sorcerer!<br />\r\neach one has different abilities, health, and power!<br />\r\nFight through every monster and boss in the game until you succeed to defend your kingdom!<br />\r\nSoon you can play against your friends 1V1 until the other loses his kingdom!<br />\r\nSo what are you waiting for?!<br />\r\nSee you inside the game!",
